    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38874" root="ملح" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْحَةٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A single feed taken by a child from the
breast.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْجَةٌ</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ج</span>, signifies a single suck.
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْحَةٌ</span> The <i>main body of the sea;</i> or
the <i>fathomless deep of the sea;</i> or <i>a great expanse</i>

<i>of sea of which the extremities cannot be seen.</i>
(K.)

